<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Soundview ups 3Com EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Soundview ups 3Com EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview analyst Michael Karfopoulos boosted his earnings estimates on 3Com Corp for the the fiscal 1997 and 1998 years.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said he expected the company to earn $2.40 per share in fiscal 1997, up from his prior estimate of $2.35, while in fiscal 1998, he estimated the company would earn $3.20 per share, up from $3.10 previously.</p>
<p>-- He left his ratings on 3Com unchanged at short-term and long-term buy.</p>
</text>
